title: miner_lament_start
tags: asteroid
---
A mining rig is silent. The drill is stuck deep in the rock. The logs say\: 'We hit a vein of something black. It's not ore. It's bleeding.' #line:miner_lament_start_00
-> Retract Drill #line:miner_lament_start_01
    <<jump miner_lament_oil_spill>>
-> Loot Rig #line:miner_lament_start_02
    <<give_item item_mining_beam_mk2 1>>
    <<stop>>
-> Destroy Asteroid <<if has_item("resource_fuel", 2)>> #line:miner_lament_start_03
    <<take_item resource_fuel 2>>
    <<add_fact rep_vanguard_ghosts 1>>
    <<stop>>
===

title: miner_lament_oil_spill
tags: 
---
You retract the drill. A geyser of raw, liquid Silence erupts. It damages your hull, but crystalizes into Dark Matter. #line:miner_lament_oil_spill_00
-> Continue #line:miner_lament_oil_spill_01
    <<damage_ship 15>>
    <<give_credits 300>>
    <<stop>>
===

